{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-08T21:21:06.571Z","data":{"text":"Done. Summary of the work:\n\n**Implementation**\n- `src/core/spec/plan-ready-record.ts` — new `recordPlanReady(projectRoot, folderPath, config)`. It skips when the folder carries `.run/approved` or `.run/rejected.md`, or when `hashChangeFolder` matches the last `readPlanReady` record's hash; otherwise it builds the digest (`buildApprovalDigest`), derives notices (`buildApprovalNotices`), appends one `plan_ready` line via `appendPlanReady` with `recordNotices`, and resolves `true`.\n- `src/cli/lint.ts` — `lintCommand` now calls `recordPlanReady` for each folder whose lint result is valid, only when explicit ids were given, in JSON mode too, and before the throw for an invalid folder.\n- `tests/plan-ready-lint.test.ts` — covers every \"Plan ready records\" scenario through `lintCommand` on temp scaffolded projects, plus that `readPlanRecords` still skips `plan_ready` lines.\n\n**Verification**\n- Task verify: 9/9 pass.\n- Targeted affected suites: 150/150 pass.\n- `pnpm verify` (proposal verify): typecheck CLI + UI, build, 3576 CLI tests + 130 UI tests, and biome lint all green.\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/160-approve-highlights/.run/results/4.md`."}}
